#
# Fail-witness for the no-duplicate ban on NORMS (charter Hard Rule 10, ex:saNoRemintNormsTerms):
# a fixture that RE-MINTS the norms term gmeow:Rubric as rdfs:isDefinedBy the preference slice —
# the AC7 no-duplication violation (Principle 16). Unioned with the preference module by the
# gmeow:saFailWitness teeth check, it makes the ∃-redeclared-term ASK HOLD, proving the mustNot
# ban catches a re-minted sibling term rather than passing vacuously. Reuse rides
# mappings/equivalences.ttl at the instance level only; the module must never carry this triple.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

gmeow:Rubric rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/preference> .
